# Phase 3: System Architecture

আমি পুরো সিস্টেমকে ৫টি প্রধান অংশে ভাগ করার পরামর্শ দেব।

### 3.1 Overall Architecture

```text
              MAIN SOFTWARE
          POS / ERP / Web / Mobile
                    |
                    |
             Print Integration
                    |
             Print Job API
                    |
          UNIVERSAL PRINT APP
                    |
          Print Job Management
                    |
          Printer Configuration
                    |
          Printing Engine
                    |
        +-----------+-----------+
        |           |           |
     Bluetooth    Wi-Fi       USB
        |           |           |
        +-----------+-----------+
                    |
              PRINTER DEVICE
```

### 3.2 Software Modules

| Module | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| Printer Discovery | Printer Search |
| Printer Manager | Add, Edit, Delete Printer |
| Connection Manager | Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, USB |
| Protocol Manager | ESC/POS, ZPL, TSPL etc. |
| Print Job Manager | Print Queue Management |
| Document Processor | PDF, Image, Text Processing |
| Print Engine | Actual Printing |
| Error Handler | Connection & Printing Errors |
| Integration API | External Software Communication |
| Device Manager | Mobile Device Management |

### 3.3 Recommended Technology Stack

| Component | Technology |
|---|---|
| Mobile UI | Flutter |
| Programming Language | Dart |
| Native Android Integration | Kotlin |
| Database | SQLite / Drift |
| API | REST API |
| Real-time Communication | WebSocket (optional) |
| Background Processing | Android Foreground Service |
| PDF Processing | Native Android PDF APIs |
| Thermal Printing | ESC/POS |
| Label Printing | ZPL / TSPL / CPCL |
| Cloud Management | Laravel API (Optional) |
| Authentication | Token-based Authentication |

**গুরুত্বপূর্ণ:** Flutter দিয়ে UI ও Application Logic তৈরি হবে। কিন্তু USB, Bluetooth Classic, Android Print Service এবং কিছু Native Printing Operation-এর জন্য Kotlin Native Integration লাগতে পারে।

