# Phase 8: Database Design

প্রথম পর্যায়ে Local SQLite Database ব্যবহার করবেন।

### 8.1 Main Tables

| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| printers | Printer Information |
| printer_connections | Connection Details |
| printer_profiles | Printer Configuration |
| print_jobs | Print Job Information |
| print_logs | Printing Logs |
| print_templates | Saved Templates |
| app_settings | Application Settings |
| paired_devices | External Software Devices |

### 8.2 Printer Table Example

```sql
CREATE TABLE printers (
    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    name TEXT NOT NULL,
    brand TEXT,
    model TEXT,
    connection_type TEXT,
    protocol TEXT,
    address TEXT,
    port INTEGER,
    paper_width INTEGER,
    is_default INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    created_at TEXT
);
```

Database-এ Printer-এর Connection Information ও Configuration রাখবেন। Bluetooth বা Wi-Fi Credentials প্রয়োজন হলে সেগুলো Secure Storage-এ রাখতে হবে।

